Corroborated by the school's own site (S2) except where noted:

- **Chick-fil-A Leadership Academy** — leadership program (roster item S1; national program;
 HGCS-specific detail not on school site).
- **Global Ambassadors** — leadership/international program (roster item S1; aggregator-only).
- **International outreach / mission trips** — ✓ S2 explicitly names **Dominican Republic,
 Ecuador, Haiti, and Kenya**.
- **HGBC Food Pantry partnership** — ✓ S2 ("HGBC Food Pantry partnership through aquaponics");
 the school runs an aquaponics program supplying the Hickory Grove Baptist Church food pantry.
- **Discipleship / small-group discipleship** — ✓ S2 ("small-group discipleship opportunities";
 monthly worship/chapels). Church-side D-Groups / mission trips context in S7.
